project and its maintainers do not endorse it.

The simulator is a new program. It contains no code from Riak. Its model
follows the behaviour, names and default settings of OpenRiak 3.4.1, from
these repositories, which are under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  https://github.com/OpenRiak/riak        (tag riak-3.4.1)
  https://github.com/OpenRiak/riak_kv
  https://github.com/OpenRiak/riak_core
  https://github.com/OpenRiak/riak_api
  https://github.com/OpenRiak/leveled

Riak was developed at Basho Technologies. The NOTICE file of OpenRiak/riak
says:

  Riak
